// LEARNING-RECORD §6 — the socratic questionnaire IS the write-time gate
// (PLUGIN-CLASS-TAXONOMY-v1 fase c, 2026-08-18): to make the write-time
// gate registry run a declared socratic tree, the ENGINE must be exposed
// by an external contract (CLI eval-tree), not imported as a Python module
// inside the orchestrator. Fase (a) built that contract; fase (c) then
// registered gate('socratic-classify') in write_gates.vsm WITHOUT touching
// write_gate_orchestrator.py — the registry stayed the only source of
// truth (DAEMON-GATE-AFTER-EARLY-EXIT lesson preserved).

